{
 "role": "baseline",
 "fix": "B40 keeps the \u00d89 boss location and 3.4 mm slots. Custom hardened M3 shoulder dog screws (\u00d82.9 at the horn face) load two \u00d86 steel inserts in the horn. The chosen boss34 id is retained for the combined rev B overlay; its contributor now models the B40 shoulder. Verify insert retention, horn rim and lash on a coupon.",
